# Rules / skills = prompts

`.mdc`, User Rules, `AGENTS.md`, and `SKILL.md` are injected context. Author them as prompts.

| Discipline | MUST |
|------------|------|
| Accurate | Match live paths, tools, and ids; fix drift on sight |
| Precise | One concern; actionable MUST / MUSTNOT; no vague fillers |
| Low noise | Pointers over paste; mdc under 120 lines; delete duplicates; `alwaysApply` only if every turn needs it |
| Consistent | One SSOT per fact across rules, skills, and AGENTS |
| Coherent | Route via SKILL-GRAPH; constraints in rules, procedure in skills |
| Abbreviations | Prefer clear English names; expand house labels on first use |
| Positive | Name the structure, then the per-item gate |

Cut before add. Verify cited files exist. Detail: `~/.cursor/skills/prompt-writing-discipline/SKILL.md`.
